{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120070","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120070/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120070/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120070/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120070","id":4608780492,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7jsWpV","number":120070,"title":"[.Net] Keep C# available after an ALC unloading faliure","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":709269775,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MDkyNjk3NzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:dotnet","name":"topic:dotnet","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","color":"ff7766","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-06-07T21:28:43Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T20:21:29Z","closed_at":"2026-07-31T20:06:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120070","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120070","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120070.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120070.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Mitigates:\r\n- #78513\r\n\r\n- Closes: godotengine/godot-proposals#11819\r\n\r\nSupersedes\r\n- #118357\r\n\r\nUnity ultimately hasn't managed to slip past the flaw in the modern ALC design: cooperative unloading, which means they are likely facing a similar issue to the one we are facing now (#78513) after they finish migrating to the modern dotnet. But in [this discussion](https://discussions.unity.com/t/path-to-coreclr-2026-upgrade-guide/1714279/7), one of the staff members mentioned that they decided to just keep the leaked ALC as is while loading the new code to a new ALC and report the leakage to the user later. \r\n\r\nQuote:\r\n> What happens when an assembly can’t be unloaded? What are the possible issues? Will there be two instances of types in that assembly: one from the newly loaded assembly and one from the one that couldn’t be unloaded? Will a newly instantiated object correctly use the new assembly?\r\n\r\n> Yes. We’re planning to report to the user after a suitable time that an AssemblyLoadContext has leaked.\r\n\r\nThis PR is a Godot implementation of the same idea, and it's shocking how little code it takes to implement such. \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/50e9954d-cbdb-4233-ba7c-e647b6dbd3c9\r\n\r\nAfter this PR, when an unloading failure occurs, we stop disabling C#; instead, we increment an internal leak count and just report it to the user.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: This doesn't fix issue #78513; it just makes the consequences of the unloading failure into additional memory usage instead of disabling C#.\r\n\r\nAI Usage: `DeepSeek V4 Pro` / `Github Copilot` is used to perform research and initial implementation; the PR author manually tested the functions against the pattern provided in #78513 to make sure the PR functions. After that, the Author made necessary manual changes so that the behavior complies with the standard Godot Editor experience.","closed_by":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120070/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":9,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120070/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}